OL,3,GNEWSAEx-teaching assistant jailed for
OL,4,Achild sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been sentenced to seven years
OL,7,Fin prison for the sexual abuse he
OL,8,Fcommitted more than three decades ago.
OL,10,FPhilip Watson, 60, of South Shields,
OL,11,Fsexually assaulted a number of
OL,12,Fschoolboys on separate occasions across
OL,13,Fthe 1990s.
OL,15,FNorthumbria Police said the offences
OL,16,Ftook place in the Sunderland and
OL,17,FNorthumberland areas when Watson was
OL,18,Femployed as a teaching assistant.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
