OL,3,GNEWSAEx-teaching assistant jailed for
OL,4,Achild sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FWatson was sentenced at Newcastle Crown
OL,7,FCourt on Thursday for four counts of
OL,8,Findecent assault on a child. He will
OL,9,Fremain on the sex offenders register
OL,10,Ffor life.
